"media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWoJKl5WgAA90SP.jpg"}, {"id": "2119517406292840496", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Hansi Flick: \"Bernal has been doing a good job this season, which is why he's starting. Fari\u00f1as is in good form and has a good understanding with Lamine. Eric isn't up to more than 30 minutes today.\" #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWoJ2YgWIAAaReR.jpg"}, {"id": "2119517570495570075", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Simeone: \"We know Bar\u00e7a press very well. It's an important, exciting match to show what the team is capable Of.\" #fcblive", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWoJ_7yXAAA7ozq.jpg"}, {"id": "2119520730454925538", "text": "1' KICK-OFF. \ud83d\udd35", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119521867019026666", "text": "4' Poor start from Bar\u00e7a so far.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119522232082849864", "text": "5' JULIAN ALVAREZ MISSES A 1v1. Bar\u00e7a are saved!", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119522344905445727", "text": "5' PUBILL HITS THE POST. BAR\u00c7A ARE SLEEPING!", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119522661642518918", "text": "7' PEDRI RATTLES THE CROSSBAR. SO CLOSE!", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119522874407240188", "text": "Alvarez CLOSE \ud83d\ude2c", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2119522625127174144/vid/avc1/1280x720/rpFNLLF75Njh4m5m.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2119523193555730843", "text": "9' Goal Atl\u00e9tico Madrid. Guiliano Simeone. 1-0. \ud83d\udd34", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119524009905913972", "text": "Simeone's OPENER. Alvarez ASSIST. \u26bd", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2119523082624811008/vid/avc1/1280x720/z4M5Pw_2Mv_mEhMR.mp4?tag=14"}, {"id": "2119525036969107745", "text": "16' Brilliant dribble and cross by Lamine to Ferm\u00edn but his shot is blocked.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119526109985276332", "text": "20' Atl\u00e9tico close to scoring their second.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119526676170166582", "text": "Lamine is cooking Grimaldo so far.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119527133059878997", "text": "Joan Garcia and Joao Cancelo after Atl\u00e9tico's goal \ud83d\udc40", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWoSseeXsAA6-kT.jpg"}, {"id": "2119527485368934518", "text": "26' Julian Alvarez inches close from making it two, stopped by Joan Garcia. Cancelo gave the ball away.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119530585127313780", "text": "38' Brilliant ball by Lamine into the box but nothing made out of it by Fermin.", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119532075938173178", "text": "GOALLLLLLLL FERM\u00cdNNNNNN. 1-1 BAR\u00c7AAAAAAAAAAA \ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udd25", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2119532281920729118", "text": "FERM\u00cdNATOR STRIKES \ud83d\udd25\u26bd", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2119531953409982464/vid/avc1/1280x720/_FrjAal2iX2w6A7O.mp4?tag=14"}, {"id": "2119532417937539539", "text": "\ud83c\udfa5 | Ferm\u00edn EQUALIZES for Bar\u00e7a right on the stroke of half time. 1-1. #fcblive \ud83d\udca5", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2119531953409982464/vid/avc1/1280x720/_FrjAal2iX2w6A7O.mp4?tag=14"}]